      "sha256": "258a47dc09cd8e36433f0bb6dfe7abe1a139d634db1c4d8a8f028ad1b8e1f632"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "fce3ba206e98aa35476876d8",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "49",
      "locator": "paragraph 49",
      "text": "Donate",
      "sha256": "c91ee0f2799df915efcc117ba063d95e0cbf0d5e8e6eca5373333bb9b06c5f13"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "5eb6212233fb0be352d50706",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "50",
      "locator": "paragraph 50",
      "text": "Sign up",
      "sha256": "5e2b8e96503d722e7ebf61b9bc3e9988e1ec7fd4eabcf25a52577f845125b31e"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "88c300c74a9a4e4eae6469e5",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "51",
      "locator": "paragraph 51",
      "text": "Welcome",
      "sha256": "0e2226b5235f0ff94a276eb4d07a3bfea74b7e3b8b85e9efca6c18430f041bf8"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "2d328694b09a37436a505f7e",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "52",
      "locator": "paragraph 52",
      "text": "Home / Welcome",
      "sha256": "8955421d784c6dfe65ad917c38fae6f759b5f3d154be7055a3a6a69bc3ef8e72"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "c41e7d381bbb346fdc886236",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "53",
      "locator": "paragraph 53",
      "text": "My name is Ali Abbas Khorasani, but you can call me Ali. I am a proud Leftist Progressive with a background in chemistry and engineering, and I have been passionate about social justice and community engagement throughout my life. After years organizing and volunteering at homeless breakfasts, interfaith engagement events, and senior center holiday concerts I realized that something more substantial needs to be done to help our fellow Americans. For this reason, I decided to run for the U.S. House of Representatives to provide a new face, new energy, and new ideas to Congress.",
      "sha256": "0fce8feff55768960835b91d33c815b32f3e2743f1ce45d5c7d1e0a31ae61294"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "4b4cbb273cf38e1988524cfb",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "54",
      "locator": "paragraph 54",
      "text": "Help us spread the word about the campaign",
      "sha256": "5c0493710f81664c01d5769c11c1d2a19d7f7bc5957ec9c2771f7f2a38af1cf9"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "674bd4bb4be7c5ed24958a85",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "55",
      "locator": "paragraph 55",
      "text": "Long-term, we would like to get money out of politics, but in the mean time we are relying on contributions from ordinary working Americans to spread the word about the campaign. Our average contribution as of Q3 was just $11, so no amount is too small to help plant seeds of revolution! Our goal is to raise $2018 before 2018 starts.",
      "sha256": "5d938ffb7c09430a9a7c2b1e2dab82ebebb828d64fdf6cfea0b1409d4cb6da57"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "f541378f0d77126cbdc81c6a",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "56",
      "locator": "paragraph 56",
      "text": "I am running for the Democratic nomination for TX-02",
      "sha256": "b10e5da8e0e80212b50b3608fcb58d391f1ab5d3977fc701e222b71d569dd587"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "b533a7ce0dd67ab5e1ee0592",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "57",
      "locator": "paragraph 57",
      "text": "and you can find me at position #2 on the Harris County ballot.",
      "sha256": "f61557059ab307d3c9d3f0a33722409264c17b8c33caf55304c5b5d933600d2b"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "ef56bd22b533516fab961aa3",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "58",
      "locator": "paragraph 58",
      "text": "I am not a lawyer, business exec, or career politician,",
      "sha256": "e90c883b3b10efb79bd55dfdb3add399eee8d196d90a6952b9d7a92d3f052d23"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "eef464cbb2bf41d801cd1154",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "59",
      "locator": "paragraph 59",
      "text": "and for that exact reason I believe I can affect change in our country that helps everyone. With my engineering background, I am acutely adept at problem solving, and as a chemist I understand empiricism and peer-review. More important than all that, though, is that I am a good listener, and I firmly believe that our Democracy is by, for, and of the PEOPLE. Before considering any political buzz-words, corporate jargon, etc., my primary concern is that the well being of our poorest and our middle class Americans is provided for by our government. I believe politics is about the many, not the few, and that we can work together to give everyone a fair shot. That’s why I want to hear from you .",
      "sha256": "e1a4501ce2af96726c211e15716fe994680c130f94c9b076564c746dcb54a51a"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "e53011841f76088019d4b70e",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "60",
      "locator": "paragraph 60",
      "text": "If elected, I will be younger than any incumbent Congressperson and finally bring a voice to Generation Y. I will bring my facts-based scientific background and troubleshooting experience to the House floor and be the change Americans wish to see.🐝🐝",
      "sha256": "23c1013c27ee4ef873443510f001eabf3a44b72510d501aa02e1aff793bf6d9b"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "d0193d77862dd001c811165b",
      "document_id": "96f62451c9bb92dc80dc1b60",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "61",
      "locator": "paragraph 61",
      "text": "This slideshow requires JavaScript.",
      "sha256": "e7343bf74bdc17c4c8853c3ab982d7dbf26de8302a062e7f7b1a0e7a6ae5f8cf"
    },
